# System-wide default desktop session for IRN OS.
#
# Read by /usr/local/bin/irn-kiosk when the user has no personal preference in
# $HOME/.config/irn/session. Parsing is deliberately forgiving: comments and all
# whitespace are stripped, and the first non-empty token wins.
#
# Valid values:
#   cinnamon   X11. Cinnamon + Settings + conky. The default.
#   labwc      Wayland. The minimal hardened shell (waybar, fuzzel, swaylock).
#
# Per-user override: `irn-session labwc` (writes ~/.config/irn/session).
cinnamon
